OL,3,GNEWSA'They're learning without
OL,4,Arealising' - how fishing is helping
OL,5,ASEND kids
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn a crisp morning, a group of
OL,8,Fchildren, who are not in mainstream
OL,9,Feducation, are sitting by a lake
OL,10,Ffishing.
OL,12,FAmong them is 10-year-old Oscar, who
OL,13,Fhas been home educated for almost his
OL,14,Fentire life.
OL,16,FHe regularly attends the angling
OL,17,Fsessions at the lake in Mill Dam Park
OL,18,Fin Kirkby as part of an initiative set
OL,19,Fup to build children's confidence and
OL,20,Fother life skills.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
